  "design_language": {
    "base": "ink_signal",
    "designmd": "---\nname: Atlas Bus Compressor\nversion: \"1\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#10B6A3\"\n  surface: \"#101417\"\n  surface_raised: \"#192126\"\n  text: \"#F2F5F4\"\n  text_muted: \"#9AA8A5\"\n  accent: \"#16DAC2\"\ntypography:\n  body:\n    family: Inter\n    size: 12\nrounded:\n  panel: 12\nspacing:\n  unit: 8\n---\n# Atlas Bus Compressor\nA controlled Ink & Signal panel language for a modern stereo bus compressor: dark machined surfaces, disciplined teal signal emphasis, restrained top-left depth, and typography that separates brand, section labels, control labels, and numeric readouts. Threshold is the tactile center of gravity; related timing, blend, and level controls orbit it in subordinate groups."
  },
  "layout": {
    "archetype": "hero_knob",
    "hero": "threshold",
    "reason": "Threshold anchors the center as a large tactile hero knob with smaller signal-flow satellites grouped left and right."
  },
